{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1547028-best-books-for-2e","id":1547028,"title":"Best books for 2e","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-12-15T09:25:08-08:00","id":1547028,"title":"Best books for 2e","content":"I recently got to a point where I actually need more content for a werewolf game I\u2019m in! Which is quite frankly a huge blessing in my life. But there are lots of books and I am not really sure which ones add the most when it comes to content. Whether the book is 1 or 2e doesn\u2019t really matter so much as the content that the book has and its potential relevance to 2e since that is the edition we\u2019re playing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28463-bwhite24","name":"Bwhite24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-15T09:50:24-08:00","id":1547032,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/282275/night-horrors-shunned-by-the-moon?affiliate_id=498510\" target=\"_blank\">Shunned by the Moon</a></b> is a must buy. Not only covers a butt load of interesting antagonists, but the essays in the back help with understanding resonance and Essence. Once you've got that squared away, it scaffolds nicely into <b><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/3771/territories?affiliate_id=498510\" target=\"_blank\">Territories</a></b>, which those essays are based on. <b><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/2402/predators?src=also_purchased&amp;affiliate_id=498510\" target=\"_blank\">Predators</a></b> is 1e, but a lot of its antagonist stats are easily switched to 2e and it has A LOT of useful information on the Forsaken's foes. Ditto with <b><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/23681/the-pure?affiliate_id=498510\" target=\"_blank\">The Pure</a></b>. Its a bit trickier to convert the mechanical elements of <b><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/23681/the-pure?affiliate_id=498510\" target=\"_blank\">Lore of the Forsaken</a></b>, but I find it has some useful information on the mindset and dynamics of werewolves, especially Chapter 1, which has sections on Luna and the Firstborn.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member"